WEBVTT

00:00:00.104 --> 00:00:07.656
Attendance already marked?

00:00:07.706 --> 00:00:11.905
Open Manual Entry, then pick the same class and date.

00:00:23.016 --> 00:00:30.179
A blue notice tells you records already exist. Saving will update them, not duplicate them.

00:00:30.728 --> 00:00:35.956
The saved statuses are loaded. Tap a student's status to correct it.

00:00:37.515 --> 00:00:44.463
Press Save Attendance. The message confirms the records were updated, with none created twice.

00:00:47.593 --> 00:00:53.444
Corrections are safe
